tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1bvjpef xt0b8zv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek xawggmj x1uhb9sk xt0psk2 x6s0dn4" href="https://developers.facebook.com/docs/graph-api/overview/rate-limiting#headers" role="link" tabindex="0">Header</a>.</div><div class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x14vqqas xod5an3">Selain itu, platform ini menerapkan beberapa batas laju pesan:</div><ul class="x1mfogq2 xrgpmi2 xtaz4m5 x1motxo8"><li class="x2lt0xw x1jchvi3 xo1l8bm xjat59b x1evy7pa x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Batas pengiriman pesan:</strong> Jumlah maksimal pengguna WhatsApp unik yang bisa dikirimi pesan, di luar periode layanan pelanggan, dalam periode 24 jam yang bergulir. Atur pada level portofolio bisnis. Lihat <a class="x1i10hfl xjbqb8w xjqpnuy xc5r6h4 xqeqjp1 x1phubyo x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1bvjpef xt0b8zv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek xawggmj x1uhb9sk xt0psk2 x6s0dn4" href="https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-messaging/whatsapp/messaging-limits" role="link" tabindex="0">Batas berkirim pesan</a>.</li><li class="x2lt0xw x1jchvi3 xo1l8bm xjat59b x1evy7pa x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Throughput:</strong> Nomor telepon bisnis bisa mengirim hingga 80 pesan per detik secara default, dengan peningkatan kapasitas tersedia. Set per nomor telepon bisnis. Lihat <a class="x1i10hfl xjbqb8w xjqpnuy xc5r6h4 xqeqjp1 x1phubyo x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1bvjpef xt0b8zv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek xawggmj x1uhb9sk xt0psk2 x6s0dn4" href="https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-messaging/whatsapp/throughput" role="link" tabindex="0">Throughput</a>.</li><li class="x2lt0xw x1jchvi3 xo1l8bm xjat59b x1evy7pa x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Peringkat kualitas:</strong> Ditetapkan per nomor telepon bisnis dan per template, dan digunakan untuk menentukan peningkatan tingkat throughput otomatis. Lihat <a class="x1i10hfl xjbqb8w xjqpnuy xc5r6h4 xqeqjp1 x1phubyo x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1bvjpef xt0b8zv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek xawggmj x1uhb9sk xt0psk2 x6s0dn4" href="https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-messaging/whatsapp/templates/template-quality" role="link" tabindex="0">Peringkat kualitas template</a>.</li></ul><div id="documentheading-4-pair-rate-limits"><div id="pair-rate-limits" style="scroll-margin-top: 80px;"><div class="xeuugli x2lwn1j x6s0dn4 x78zum5 x1r0jzty x17zd0t2 xyamay9"><h4 class="x19a1ety x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x1a2a7pz xxqhfby">Batas laju pasangan</h4><div class="x1i10hfl x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1n2onr6 x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1hl2dhg x1lku1pv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek x197sbye x78zum5 xl56j7k x6s0dn4 x4nc2kg x155eyjv xrpzz58 x102p2p6 xus0ocu x1c9tyrk xeusxvb x1pahc9y x1ertn4p x1td3qas x10w6t97 x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd" role="button" tabindex="0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="x1lliihq x1d43ie2 xlup9mm x1kky2od" role="img"><path d="M12.924 5.14c1.42-1.52 3.565-1.52